{"record_id": "RMUC2027:6.5:p122:p001", "record_type": "block", "sample": "multi_section_page", "doc_id": "RMUC2027", "version": "V1.0.0", "source_file": "RoboMaster 2027 机甲大师超级对抗赛比赛规则手册V1.0.0（20261015）-官方版.pdf", "sha256": "9E2EED9295536C6FD547B62D634DF1D5E70A2E1E2250E5DFF3521D557E5D54BE", "section": {"section_id": 101, "section_no": "6.5", "title": "6.5 五秒裁判系统自检阶段", "name": "五秒裁判系统自检阶段", "level": 2, "path": ["6 比赛流程", "6.5 五秒裁判系统自检阶段"]}, "physical_page": 122, "printed_page": 121, "physical_pages": [122], "bbox": [51.36, 553.77, 538.8, 603.65], "block_kind": "paragraph", "raw_text": "十五秒裁判系统自检阶段结束后，比赛进入五秒倒计时。此时，裁判系统选手端将不响应机器人控制指令\n（包括自定义终端），倒计时结束后裁判系统选手端恢复响应机器人控制指令，比赛立即开始。 ", "norm_text": "十五秒裁判系统自检阶段结束后，比赛进入五秒倒计时。此时，裁判系统选手端将不响应机器人控制指令（包括自定义终端），倒计时结束后裁判系统选手端恢复响应机器人控制指令，比赛立即开始。", "source_lines": [{"page": 122, "bbox": [56.64, 553.77, 538.8, 583.97], "text": "十五秒裁判系统自检阶段结束后，比赛进入五秒倒计时。此时，裁判系统选手端将不响应机器人控制指令"}, {"page": 122, "bbox": [51.36, 573.45, 490.04, 603.65], "text": "（包括自定义终端），倒计时结束后裁判系统选手端恢复响应机器人控制指令，比赛立即开始。 "}], "line_count": 2, "cross_page": false, "normalization": {"rules": ["join_visual_linebreaks", "map_pua_bullets", "collapse_whitespace"], "chars_preserved": true}, "extraction": {"engine": "PyMuPDF 1.28.2 get_text('dict')", "fonts": ["SourceHanSerifSC-Light"], "max_font_size": 10.56, "assembled_from": "visual lines merged by geometry"}, "flags": {"is_heading": false, "is_list_item": false, "is_caption": false, "inside_table": false, "uses_cambria_math": false, "script_span_count": 0, "starts_with_figure_marker": false, "contains_formula": false, "contains_digit": false, "contains_greek": false, "contains_compare": false, "contains_unit": false}}
